\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 나눔지기 활동</span></font></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;활동 내용 : 저소득층 가정의 학생을 중심으로 국어, 영어, 수학 등 </span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 교과목 학습 지도 및 예체능 지도 등 특기적성 교육</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 진로지도 및 고민상담, 자기주도 학습법 및 학습 동기부여 활동 등</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 활동장소 : 멘토링 활동은 반드시 근로기관 내에서 진행되어야함</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 활동시간 : 학기당 최소 10시간, 1일 최대4시간</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 주당 최대(학기 중 10시간, 방학 중 20시간)</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 학기당 10시간 미만의 활동에 대해서는 인정되지 않음</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 분 단위 활동에 대해서는 인정되지 않음</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 마. 일시적인 휴강, 공결 등으로 인하여 발생된 시간에 이루어진 활동</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 은&nbsp;그 시간이 학업시간표와 중복되어 인정되지 않음</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 바. 나눔지기의 학적이 변동될 경우, 변동당일의 활동까지만 인정</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">봉사활동 시간 인정 불가</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2. 지급기준</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 시급단가 : 9,500원</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 근로에 대한 대가로 장학금이 지급됨으로 봉사활동 시간 불인정</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 지급절차 : 근로기관 담당자가 승인한 출근부를 최종 확인 후 </span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나눔지기에게 장학금 지급</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 지급방법 : 익월 20일(변경시 사전 공지)</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;3. 일 정</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 기관방문 : 4.20(월) ~ 4.24(금)</span></font></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb